---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Portfolio
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="intro page-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="intro-profile">
    <p class="mono-note">portfolio / analytics</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">hi, i'm <span>{{ site.name }}</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></h1>
    <p class="intro-role">{{ site.role }}</p>
    <nav class="profile-links" aria-label="Quick links">
      <a href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span> work</a>
      {% if site.github %}<a href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span> github</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/resume/' | url }}"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span> résumé</a>{% endif %}
      {% if site.linkedin %}<a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span> linkedin</a>{% else %}<a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span> contact</a>{% endif %}
    </nav>
    <div class="mini-signal" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="mini-signal-label">signal / noise</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 230 132">
        <path class="mini-grid" d="M12 24H218M12 56H218M12 88H218M12 120H218M48 12V120M88 12V120M128 12V120M168 12V120M208 12V120"/>
        <path class="mini-trend" d="M14 104C42 105 50 82 72 86S108 70 123 61 153 68 169 42 196 34 218 18"/>
        <g class="mini-points"><circle cx="28" cy="93" r="3"/><circle cx="51" cy="101" r="2"/><circle cx="72" cy="79" r="4"/><circle cx="95" cy="85" r="2"/><circle cx="117" cy="60" r="3"/><circle cx="141" cy="70" r="2"/><circle cx="166" cy="43" r="4"/><circle cx="190" cy="48" r="2"/><circle cx="215" cy="18" r="3"/></g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-overview">
    <div class="data-doodles" aria-hidden="true"><span class="doodle-bars"></span><span class="doodle-orbit"></span><span class="doodle-spark">⌁</span></div>
    <p class="intro-statement">{{ site.intro }}</p>
    <div class="fact-grid">
      {% for fact in site.facts %}
      <article>
        <h2><span>[{{ fact.number }}]</span> {{ fact.label }}</h2>
        <p>{{ fact.value }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
      <article>
        <h2><span>[04]</span> status</h2>
        <p>{{ site.availability }} · {{ site.location }}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <figure class="data-portrait">
      <div class="data-portrait-label"><span>FIG. 01</span><span>AN ANALYTICAL POINT OF VIEW</span></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 720 250" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs><pattern id="portrait-grid" width="24" height="24" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M24 0H0V24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".12"/></pattern><linearGradient id="portrait-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#dff3ed"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e9eefb"/></linearGradient></defs>
        <rect width="720" height="250" rx="20" fill="url(#portrait-fill)"/><rect width="720" height="250" rx="20" fill="url(#portrait-grid)"/>
        <g class="portrait-bars"><rect x="56" y="150" width="28" height="52" rx="4"/><rect x="94" y="119" width="28" height="83" rx="4"/><rect x="132" y="78" width="28" height="124" rx="4"/><rect x="170" y="104" width="28" height="98" rx="4"/></g>
        <path class="portrait-line" d="M247 179C288 177 302 119 342 132S397 158 429 95 496 58 539 88 598 97 665 40"/>
        <g class="portrait-points"><circle cx="247" cy="179" r="6"/><circle cx="342" cy="132" r="6"/><circle cx="429" cy="95" r="6"/><circle cx="539" cy="88" r="6"/><circle cx="665" cy="40" r="7"/></g>
        <text x="55" y="41">STRUCTURE</text><text x="247" y="216">CONTEXT</text><text x="601" y="216">CLARITY →</text>
      </svg>
      <figcaption>Turning a messy question into a decision someone can use.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="expertise-strip page-shell" aria-label="Core analytics interests"><span class="strip-label">the work, in a few words</span><span>analysis</span><i aria-hidden="true">·</i><span>visualization</span><i aria-hidden="true">·</i><span>experimentation</span><i aria-hidden="true">·</i><span>decision-making</span></div>

<section id="selected-work" class="work-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">selected analytics work</p><h2 id="work-title">analysis in practice <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h2></div>
    <div class="section-heading-side"><p>Questions, methods, evidence, and what the work made possible.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">view every project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  {% if collections.projects | hasExamples %}<p class="section-note">Starter case studies are clearly labeled. Replace them with your own work when you are ready.</p>{% endif %}
  <div class="project-grid project-grid-home">
  {% for project in collections.projects | featured | limit(3) %}{% set featuredCard = loop.first %}{% set projectNumber = loop.index | pad %}{% include 'components/project-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="experience-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">experience / at a glance</p><h2 id="experience-title">where i've put it to work.</h2></div>
    <div class="section-heading-side"><p>A quick employer-facing view of roles, scope, and outcomes. Keep only the entries that strengthen your story.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/resume/' | url }}">full résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="experience-list">
    {% for item in experience %}
    <article class="experience-row">
      <div class="experience-meta"><span>[{{ loop.index | pad }}]</span><time>{{ item.period }}</time>{% if item.example %}<span class="sample-label">Template entry</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <div><p class="experience-org">{{ item.organization }}</p><h3>{{ item.role }}</h3><p>{{ item.summary }}</p></div>
      <p class="experience-highlight"><span>proof point</span>{{ item.highlight }}</p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="approach-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">how i work</p><h2 id="approach-title">from a question to a useful answer.</h2></div>
    <div class="section-heading-side"><p>A simple process keeps the work rigorous, legible, and tied to a real decision.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">more about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="approach-grid">
    <article><span>[01]</span><h3>frame</h3><p>Clarify the decision, audience, constraints, and what success should mean.</p></article>
    <article><span>[02]</span><h3>validate</h3><p>Understand the source, test assumptions, and make limitations visible.</p></article>
    <article><span>[03]</span><h3>analyze</h3><p>Choose the simplest method that can answer the question well.</p></article>
    <article><span>[04]</span><h3>explain</h3><p>Connect evidence to an action with clear visuals and plain language.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="credential-shortcut"><span class="credential-mark" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><p>Education, certifications, and continued learning live in one place.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/credentials/' | url }}">view credentials <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
</section>

<section class="writing-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">notes from the work</p><h2 id="writing-title">thinking out loud.</h2></div>
    <div class="section-heading-side"><p>Short explanations of project choices, analytical habits, and lessons worth keeping.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/writing/' | url }}">all writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="writing-list">{% for post in collections.posts | limit(2) %}<article class="writing-row"><span class="writing-index">[{{ loop.index | pad }}]</span><div><div class="card-kicker">{{ post.data.category }}{% if post.data.example %}<span class="sample-label">Sample article</span>{% endif %}</div><h3><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p></div><span class="reading-time">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</span></article>{% endfor %}</div>
</section>

<section class="contact-band page-shell" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">one more data point</p><h2 id="contact-title">open to the next good question.</h2><p>For analytics roles, project conversations, or a simple hello.</p></div>
  <a class="button" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">let's talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
